I start filling out the digital form on my phone.
Some of my information is already given in the form.
Usually, technical issues occur on government websites.
It takes a lot of time for pages to load.
But tonight this website is running quite well.
All the pages are opening quickly.
First of all, I check my mobile number.
It is nine eight seven six five, four three two one zero.
The number is absolutely correct.
Then I also look at my flat number and full address.
After this, I fill the empty spaces of the form.
According to the portal's instructions, new information is filled in every empty box.
On this website, the payment of all bills is done online.
Therefore, having the correct information in the account is very important.
Usually, I do not like doing such boring tasks at all.
I often keep putting them off.
But today it is happening very easily.
I read the entire form carefully once again and press the submit button.
